    "text": "wtoc.com\nwebsite\nCandler County, Georgia\nMan indicted for murder 15 years later in Candler County\nBy Olivia Wright,\n1 days agoCANDLER COUNTY, Ga. (WTOC) - 15 years after a murder in Candler County, loved ones of the victim are finally one step closer to getting justice. The GBI has confirmed that 48-year-old Paul Thomas Reinberg has been indicted by the Candler County grand jury for the murder of 21-year-old Harrison Wayne Olliff from Statesboro.",
